        "original_id": "de5da716-dae4-5ad7-bf1c-d2b4d286838d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michele Landis Dauber, Aaron Persky, Brock Allen Turner\n- Organizations: Santa Clara County Superior Court\n- Events: People v. Turner, recall effort against Aaron Persky\n- Places: Santa Clara County, California\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, People of the State of California v. Brock Allen Turner, known as People v. Turner, was filed in Santa Clara County Superior Court.\n- People v. Turner convicted Brock Allen Turner of three counts of felony sexual assault.\n- Aaron Persky was the Santa Clara County judge who rendered the verdict in People v. Turner.\n- Michele Landis Dauber was involved in efforts to recall Judge Aaron Persky.",
